<http://data.silknow.org/object/026152a6-d5bb-3f6b-9735-83da8b3056ca>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Woven silk brocaded with silk and metal thread\nDisplayed behind glass.\nDark blue silk warp; dark blue silk ground weft.\nBrocading wefts: green, pink and orange silk and silver strip S-wound on a white silk core.\nSelvedge: one cord of plied white silk.\nDark blue ground with an unpatterned area at the bottom and then rows of a repeated motif: a bird with a large crest sitting on a short branch with a flower near the base and buds on top.  There is a butterfly by the buds.  There are 2 small cloud-like motifs between the birds on their branches.  The birds alternate direction in alternate rows."@en , "brocaded, 1800-1860, Persian; Birds, flowers and butterflies"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/82a90e6e-3b40-33d5-8a0a-8d16be0db844> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Woven silk brocaded with silk and metal thread\nDisplayed behind glass.\nDark blue silk warp; dark blue silk ground weft.\nBrocading wefts: green, pink and orange silk and silver strip S-wound on a white silk core.\nSelvedge: one cord of plied white silk.\nDark blue ground with an unpatterned area at the bottom and then rows of a repeated motif: a bird with a large crest sitting on a short branch with a flower near the base and buds on top.  There is a butterfly by the buds.  There are 2 small cloud-like motifs between the birds on their branches.  The birds alternate direction in alternate rows."@en , "brocaded, 1800-1860, Persian; Birds, flowers and butterflies"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/026152a6-d5bb-3f6b-9735-83da8b3056ca/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/026152a6-d5bb-3f6b-9735-83da8b3056ca/dimension/1> ;
